# Release image = API runtime closure for the PR Guardian wedge, the
# operational-intelligence triggers, and the control-plane worker (see
# Dockerfile, app/import_closure.py). Every first-party package the image
# needs is COPYed explicitly, so this file only has to keep build-context
# noise out and to exclude any shipped module that imports an unshipped
# package (none today; tests/test_image_import_closure.py enforces that).
